;; 2-2-exit: the original's pieces for the other map difficulties and for heroes with level flags
;; (generated by tools/levelgen/convert-smbc.mjs --layers from levelDataSmb.xml; do not edit by hand).
;; Classic play lays, in order, each layer whose flags the hero has and whose difficulty is the
;; run's or any (level/layers.ts). The .map file holds Normal for a hero with no flags.

